[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15609.75, "timestamp": "04:20:09", "text": "這更像是亞馬遜之類的付費訂閱服務。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15611.11, "timestamp": "04:20:11", "text": "哦，是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15614.229, "timestamp": "04:20:14", "text": "。此外，你還可以直接購買高級飛機，或購買包含多種物品的高級套餐。和其他遊戲一樣，這是捆綁銷售的。明白了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15626.469, "timestamp": "04:20:26", "text": "印度"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15629.91, "timestamp": "04:20:29", "text": "飛機放在那裡。  嗯。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15639.67, "timestamp": "04:20:39", "text": "你只需要參加活動，激活活動，然後盡情發揮就行了。你必須拼盡全力去玩"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15642.149, "timestamp": "04:20:42", "text": "。  它會顯示"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15649.269, "timestamp": "04:20:49", "text": "一個類似"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15651.75, "timestamp": "04:20:51", "text": "Scotton 車輛的長條圖"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15654.87, "timestamp": "04:20:54", "text": "。"}]